// Washington Research and Media Literacy (RML), Grades 6 to 9. Each grade has a research and sources unit (RML.1,
// RML.4, RML.5: inquiry, accurate information, credibility of people and of content-generating technology) and a media
// messages unit (RML.2, RML.3: reactions, purposes and techniques). Grade 9 cites the 9–10 band.

